  "obligation": "Scalar/nullable func/extern global imports preserve original identity, type and mutability; reads/writes/reexports alias one traced owner. Immutable get-global initializers create an independent global initialized from the imported value.",
  "representation": "Cell::WasmGlobal owns Value, type and mutability. Imported environments retain that same Value. WasmGlobalInitializer holds a static value, expected import type/name, or ordered immutable dependency. Type projections follow earlier declarations; no copied global-value maps. Shared WasmGlobalGet/Set opcodes access the cell using ordinary captured bindings and dispatch. GC traces the current payload; profiling accounts the cell; JSON omits internal cells.",
  "import_authority": "One import_names projection derives host lookup indices from global/memory/table declarations for runtime lookup and static index-domain validation. Link checks enforce exact supported scalar/reference type and mutability; wrong kind, stale roots and missing imports remain typed link failures. Spectest globals use ordinary frontend/shared instantiation.",
